AaveV3Adapter_deposit
  ├── when the caller is not the vault
  │   └── it should revert
  └── when the caller is the vault
      ├── when the actual deposited amount is less than the amount requested
      │   └── it should revert
      └── when the actual deposited amount is at least the amount requested
          ├── it should emit a Deposit event
          └── it should supply USDC to the Aave V3 pool
